      "body": "India Pesticides Limited has announced that Mr. Adesh Kumar Gupta (DIN: 00020403), Independent Director of the Company, has completed his first term as an Independent Director on January 22, 2026, and accordingly ceased to be an Independent Director of the Company with effect from the closure of business hours on January 22, 2026. Consequent upon the completion of the aforesaid first term, Mr. Adesh Kumar Gupta has also ceased to be a member and/or Chairman of the Committees of the Company. Mr. Adesh Kumar Gupta is not debarred from holding the office of Director by any SEBI order or any other such authority.",
